TEXT 0 240 Left 2 !.ac dec 1000 5 1k
TEXT 0 560 Left 2 ;SEAS 26W/8534G00 - vented box, re-fitted to the lab input-impedance measurement (Lab D, Fig. 1; L = 200 mm port).\nDriver = same lab values as the closed-box model: Re = 5.7, Le = 0.76 mH, Bl = 7.98 Tm, Mmd = 39.94 g, Rms = 0.575 kg/s, Sd = 349 cm^2, Ma1f = 3.08. Cms = 1.012 mm/N is the FREE-AIR compliance (fs = 22.8 Hz); the closed-box file uses 0.35 mm/N, which already has the box folded in.\nBox: Cab = 0.62 uF = Vab/(rho*c^2) -> Vab = 88 L (rho = 1.2, c = 344). Mab = 0 (as in the closed-box file). Leak Ral = 79.4 kOhm.\nPort: total acoustic mass 89.65 kg/m^4 = Map 81.0 + Ma1p 8.65 (gives fB = 1/(2*pi*sqrt(M*Cab)) = 21.8 Hz). Port losses = Rser 312.6 on Map (acoustic ohm).\nVd3 = vent, Vd4 = diaphragm, Vd5 = total radiated (current in Cab). Impedance: plot 1/I(Vd1) (Veg = 1 V). Expect peaks near 11.3 Hz and 45 Hz, dip near 22 Hz.
